hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"524","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Najd ki taraf ghazwa kya. To ham dushman key muqaabley huey aur unkey liye saf baandhi. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamein namaz padhaanay key liye khadey huey. To aik giroh Aap key sath namaz padhtey huey khada hua aur aik giroh dushman ki taraf mutawajjeh hua. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unkey sath jo Aap key paas they ruku kya aur do sajdey kiye. Phir wo us giroh ki jagah wapas gaey jis ne namaz na padhi thi. To wo aey aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unkey sath aik rakat ruku kya aur do sajdey kiye, phir salaam phera. To un mein se har aik khada hua aur apne liye aik rakat ruku kya aur do sajdey kiye. (Bukhari: 942)"
"525","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se aik riwayat mein hai, unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha: Aur agar wo us se zyada hon to khadey ho kar aur sawaar ho kar namaz padhein. (Bukhari: 943)"
"526","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ham se farmaya jab Aap Ahzaab se wapas aey: Tum mein se koi Asr na padhey magar Bani Quraiza mein. To raastey mein baaz ko Asr ne paa liya. To baaz ne kaha: Ham na padhengey yahan tak ke wahaan aaein. Aur baaz ne kaha: Balke ham padhengey, ham se ye muraad nahi liya gaya. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se zikr kya gaya to Aap ne un mein se kisi ko malaamat na ki. (Bukhari: 946). Kitaab-ul-Eidain."
